---
---

<section id="work" class="work">
  <article class="feature">
    <div class="image-group">
      <img src="/images/portfolio/eurofighters.jpg" alt="Aerospace photography" loading="lazy" />
      <div class="thumbs">
        <img src="/images/portfolio/f15.jpg" alt="Aviation photography" loading="lazy" />
        <img src="/images/portfolio/schipol.jpg" alt="Airport photography" loading="lazy" />
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="copy">
      <p class="label">Aerospace & Technology</p>
      <h2>Communicating complex industries clearly.</h2>
      <p>From aviation to engineering, I create imagery that helps organisations explain capability, innovation and expertise.</p>
    </div>
  </article>

  <article class="feature reverse">
    <div class="image-group">
      <img src="/images/portfolio/amy.jpg" alt="Corporate portrait photography" loading="lazy" />
      <div class="thumbs">
        <img src="/images/portfolio/girlportrait.jpg" alt="Portrait photography" loading="lazy" />
        <img src="/images/portfolio/headshot.jpg" alt="Professional headshot photography" loading="lazy" />
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="copy">
      <p class="label">People & Culture</p>
      <h2>Putting real people at the heart of organisations.</h2>
      <p>Authentic portraits and workplace photography that build trust and show the human side of a business.</p>
    </div>
  </article>

  <article class="feature">
    <div class="image-group">
      <img src="/images/portfolio/dewaltsaw.jpg" alt="Product photography" loading="lazy" />
      <div class="thumbs">
        <img src="/images/portfolio/pulsarfashion.jpg" alt="Fashion photography" loading="lazy" />
        <img src="/images/portfolio/rallycar.jpg" alt="Automotive photography" loading="lazy" />
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="copy">
      <p class="label">Brands & Products</p>
      <h2>Images that make products memorable.</h2>
      <p>Commercial photography created to help brands communicate quality, performance and personality.</p>
    </div>
  </article>
</section>

<style>
.work { padding: 5rem 0; }
.feature { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1.5fr .8fr; gap:3.5rem; align-items:center; margin-bottom:5rem; }
.reverse { grid-template-columns:1.5fr .8fr; }
.reverse .image-group { order:2; }
.image-group > img { width:100%; aspect-ratio:5/3; object-fit:cover; }
.thumbs { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr); gap:1rem; margin-top:1rem; }
.thumbs img { width:100%; aspect-ratio:1/1; object-fit:cover; }
.label { text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.12em; font-size:.75rem; }
h2 { font-size:clamp(1.8rem,3vw,3rem); }
.copy p { font-size:1rem; }
@media(max-width:800px){.feature,.reverse{display:block}.reverse .image-group{order:initial}.copy{margin-top:2rem}}
</style>
